{
    "title": "POCKET COMICS: Premium Webtoon",
    "description": "With POCKET COMICS, you can read LOVE IN ALL FLAVORS & find your favorite taste in webcomics!\r\n\r\nOur ever-expanding collection of manga and webtoons include crowd-favorite fantasyromance manhwas such as \u201cI Can\u2019t Keep Up With My Stallion Duke\u201d, \u201cAnother Typical Fantasy Romance\u201d and \u201cSacrificed\u201d.\r\nOf course, we have Isekai & rebirth titles like \u201cAll Hail Lady Blanche\u201d and \u201cLady to Queen\u201d, as well as hit Drama-romance mangas including \u201cNullitas - the Counterfeit Bride\u201d.\r\n\r\n\r\nFitting to our reputation of \u2018romance-specialist platform\u2019, we have modern romance mangas Like \u201cThe Boss\u2019 Shotgun Wedding\u201d and \u201cEmbrace My Shadow\u201d. Our wide comics range does not stop there, as it expands to the genres of BL and GL, with one of our favorite BL webcomic being \u201c2Gether: The Series\u201c and \u201cThe Forbidden Peach\u201d, and many more!\r\nOur app offers a unique and enjoyable reading experience with features that make it easy to find, read, and share your favorite mangas.\r\n\r\nYou'll always have access to new and exciting webtoons that you won't find anywhere else. To help you explore our collection, we offer daily free coins and tickets. This means you can try out any of our 800+ manhwas and comics for free! The variety will surely surprise you and give you plenty to read, whether you're on a bus ride or in bed before you go to sleep.\r\n\r\nPlus, with our Wait Until Free system, new episodes are released for free every 23 hours! Our curation and recommendation system makes it easy to discover new manga that you'll love. We constantly update our collection with new manhwas and make recommendations based on your reading history.\r\n\r\nYou can see what's most popular on our TRENDING tab, so you don't miss out on the reading trend of others. Your reading list will always be filled with to-reads with POCKET COMICS.\r\n\r\nPOCKET COMICS also allows you to share your ideas, opinions, and reviews of all the manga and webtoons. You can find out what others think and form a fan-club of your own on every episode! Our comment sections provide a safe and enjoyable way to connect with other manga fans and share your love for your favorite manhwas. Join our safe and enjoyable community of manga fans today and start reading your favorite romantic manga and webtoons!\r\n\r\nOur mission is to create a platform where manga and webtoon lovers can connect, discover new webtoons, and share their love for the art of manga. Download POCKET COMICS today and start reading!",
    "descriptionHTML": "With POCKET COMICS, you can read LOVE IN ALL FLAVORS &amp; find your favorite taste in webcomics!<br><br>Our ever-expanding collection of manga and webtoons include crowd-favorite fantasyromance manhwas such as \u201cI Can\u2019t Keep Up With My Stallion Duke\u201d, \u201cAnother Typical Fantasy Romance\u201d and \u201cSacrificed\u201d.<br>Of course, we have Isekai &amp; rebirth titles like \u201cAll Hail Lady Blanche\u201d and \u201cLady to Queen\u201d, as well as hit Drama-romance mangas including \u201cNullitas - the Counterfeit Bride\u201d.<br><br><br>Fitting to our reputation of \u2018romance-specialist platform\u2019, we have modern romance mangas Like \u201cThe Boss\u2019 Shotgun Wedding\u201d and \u201cEmbrace My Shadow\u201d. Our wide comics range does not stop there, as it expands to the genres of BL and GL, with one of our favorite BL webcomic being \u201c2Gether: The Series\u201c and \u201cThe Forbidden Peach\u201d, and many more!<br>Our app offers a unique and enjoyable reading experience with features that make it easy to find, read, and share your favorite mangas.<br><br>You&#39;ll always have access to new and exciting webtoons that you won&#39;t find anywhere else. To help you explore our collection, we offer daily free coins and tickets. This means you can try out any of our 800+ manhwas and comics for free! The variety will surely surprise you and give you plenty to read, whether you&#39;re on a bus ride or in bed before you go to sleep.<br><br>Plus, with our Wait Until Free system, new episodes are released for free every 23 hours! Our curation and recommendation system makes it easy to discover new manga that you&#39;ll love. We constantly update our collection with new manhwas and make recommendations based on your reading history.<br><br>You can see what&#39;s most popular on our TRENDING tab, so you don&#39;t miss out on the reading trend of others. Your reading list will always be filled with to-reads with POCKET COMICS.<br><br>POCKET COMICS also allows you to share your ideas, opinions, and reviews of all the manga and webtoons. You can find out what others think and form a fan-club of your own on every episode! Our comment sections provide a safe and enjoyable way to connect with other manga fans and share your love for your favorite manhwas. Join our safe and enjoyable community of manga fans today and start reading your favorite romantic manga and webtoons!<br><br>Our mission is to create a platform where manga and webtoon lovers can connect, discover new webtoons, and share their love for the art of manga. Download POCKET COMICS today and start reading!",
